ion.","cites":["PANW.ocf.2026","PANW.capex.2026","PANW.revenue.2026","PANW.ocf.2021","PANW.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $1.8 billion in FY2026, 15.5% of revenue, against 21% in FY2021.","cites":["PANW.sbc.2026","PANW.revenue.2026","PANW.sbc.2021","PANW.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $1 billion to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["PANW.buybacks.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-10-31 revenue was $3.4 billion, up 39.2% from $2.5 billion in the three months ended 2025-10-31.","cites":["PANW.d.revenue.2026-08-01.2026-10-31","PANW.d.revenue.2025-08-01.2025-10-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-31 revenue added up to $12.5 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $482 million and net income to $455 million.","cites":["PANW.d.revenue.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","PANW.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.revenue.2025-08-01.2026-07-31","PANW.d.revenue.2025-08-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.revenue.2026-08-01.2026-10-31","PANW.d.opinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","PANW.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.opinc.2025-08-01.2026-07-31","PANW.d.opinc.2025-08-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.opinc.2026-08-01.2026-10-31","PANW.d.netinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","PANW.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.netinc.2025-08-01.2026-07-31","PANW.d.netinc.2025-08-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.netinc.2026-08-01.2026-10-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $4.3 billion: operating cash flow of $4.7 billion less capital spending of $443 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["PANW.d.ocf.2025-08-01.2026-01-31","PANW.d.ocf.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","PANW.d.ocf.2025-08-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.ocf.2025-08-01.2026-07-31","PANW.d.ocf.2026-08-01.2026-10-31","PANW.d.capex.2025-08-01.2026-01-31","PANW.d.capex.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","PANW.d.capex.2025-08-01.2026-04-30","PANW.d.capex.2025-08-01.2026-07-31","PANW.d.capex.2026-08-01.2026-10-31"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $21.2 billion at the end of FY2026, against $15.8 billion a year earlier. That is 184.7% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["PANW.rpo.2026","PANW.rpo.2025","PANW.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $7.7 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $6.3 billion a year earlier.","cites":["PANW.deferred.2026","PANW.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 21,921 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $524,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["PANW.q.employees","PANW.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $2.5 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $557 million in short-term investments, and $1.8 billion of debt as tagged (ConvertibleDebtNoncurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $1.3 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["PANW.cash.2026","PANW.sti.2026","PANW.debtLong.2026"]}]},"fin":{"PANW":{}},"quotes":{"PANW.q.employees":{"c":"PANW","kind":"employees","n":21921,"quote":"For example, from the end of fiscal 2025 to the end of fiscal 2026, our headcount increased from 16,068 to 21,921 employees, including approximately 4,223 additional headcount as a result of the CyberArk acquisition.","source":"PANW-0001327567-26-000023","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","date":"2026-09-10","proof":"2fe307cb2bd7b0d9785af483452cda30fc88fd376d9c422c53c64d058a767799"}}}